---
/**
 * Chapter 10 — what is published, under what licence, and why nothing is filled.
 *
 * Lifted out of `pages/index.astro` unchanged when the document became ten
 * routes.
 *
 * It made three promises and kept two. This docstring said 「under what
 * licence」 and the entry page's index says 「三層資料的內容、授權，以及這個專案
 * 為什麼不補值」 — and the rendered section was 610 characters containing the
 * word 授權 exactly zero times, along with no CC BY, no MIT, and no link to the
 * repository. Two headings now, because a chapter that answers three questions
 * should show three answers, and the licence is one of them.
 *
 * The rights below are transcribed from LICENSE, LICENSE-DATA and
 * docs/legal.md, not restated from memory. One thing is deliberately NOT copied
 * from README.md: it credits 「環境部與交通部中央氣象署」, but README.md's own
 * source table marks the CWA feed ⬜ 尚未取得 — every meteorological variable
 * used here comes from the air-quality stations' own instruments. Crediting a
 * source the work never used is worse than crediting none.
 */
import { asset, dataFiles, hourlyObservationsShort, layerBytes, mb } from "../lib/data";
import { repoFile } from "../lib/repo";
import ChapterIntro from "./ChapterIntro.astro";

import meta from "../../public/data/meta.json";

interface PublicationConflictRecord {
  station_name: string;
  effective_from: string;
  source_url: string;
  pollutant: string;
  rows_at_or_after_event: number;
  numeric_rows_at_or_after_event: number;
  null_rows_at_or_after_event: number;
  last_post_event_ts: string | null;
}

interface PublicationConflictSummary {
  status: "available" | "unavailable";
  records?: PublicationConflictRecord[];
  reason?: string;
}

const publicationConflicts = (meta as { station_publication_conflicts?: PublicationConflictSummary })
  .station_publication_conflicts;
const wanliPm25Conflict =
  publicationConflicts?.status === "available"
    ? publicationConflicts.records?.find(
        (record) => record.station_name === "萬里" && record.pollutant === "PM2.5",
      )
    : undefined;
const integer = new Intl.NumberFormat("zh-TW");
const zhDate = (value: string) => {
  const [year, month, day] = value.slice(0, 10).split("-").map(Number);
  return `${year} 年 ${month} 月 ${day} 日`;
};
---

<section id="data" class="page">
  <ChapterIntro slug="data">
  <p class="lede">
    所有數字都可以獨立重算。原始資料來自環境部空氣品質監測網公開的年度逐時檔，
    管線、品管規則、分析程式全部開源。
  </p>
  </ChapterIntro>

  {/*
    A list, not three cards.

    Three cards across this column gave each description 298px, which is
    eleven Chinese characters a line — the narrowest measure on the site, in a
    section whose whole job is explaining what you can download. And the three
    are a sequence rather than a set of alternatives: the same observations at
    coarsening resolution. A term-and-description list says that, and gives the
    prose a width it can be read at.
  */}
  <div class="primary-register" data-primary-evidence>
    <h2>三層資料</h2>

    <dl class="layers">
      <dt>L0 站-月</dt>
      <dd>每個測項一個 JSON，含月均值與該月的有效天數。網站直接讀這一層。</dd>

      <dt>L1 站-日</dt>
      <dd>每個測項一個 Parquet，共 {mb(layerBytes.l1)}。供 DuckDB-WASM 或桌面工具使用。</dd>

      <dt>L2 站-時</dt>
      <dd>
        {hourlyObservationsShort}筆完整逐時觀測，含每一筆的品管旗標。<strong>不發布</strong>——
        只發衍生產物與完整管線，執行一次 <code>twair ingest</code> 加{" "}
        <code>twair build</code> 即可獨立重建。
      </dd>
    </dl>
  </div>

  <h2>下載</h2>

  <p>
    二十一個測項，每個測項兩層。全部 {mb(layerBytes.l0 + layerBytes.l1)}，
    直接從這個網站取得，不需要註冊也不經過任何伺服器端處理。
  </p>

  {/*
    A table, because there are three things to compare per row and 21 rows of
    them: a reader looking for one measurand scans the first column, and a
    reader sizing up the download scans the last two. The file sizes come from
    `manifest.json` — the same file CI checks — so a number here cannot drift
    from the bytes actually served.

    `download` on the anchors, so a Parquet does not open as a wall of mojibake
    in a tab, and a JSON does not either. The href goes through `asset()`,
    which was the only base-path helper in the codebase and until now had no
    callers while six other files inlined their own copy of the same rule.
  */}
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="dense">
      <caption>三層資料的 L0 與 L1，逐測項。檔案大小取自匯出時寫下的 manifest。</caption>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">測項</th>
          <th scope="col">涵蓋期間</th>
          <th scope="col">L0 站-月</th>
          <th scope="col">L1 站-日</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {
          dataFiles.map((f) => (
            <tr>
              <td>
                {f.name_zh}
                <span class="code">{f.pollutant}</span>
              </td>
              <td class="span">
                {f.months[0]}–{f.months[1]}
              </td>
              <td>
                <a href={asset(f.l0.path)} download>
                  JSON
                </a>
                <span class="size">{mb(f.l0.bytes)}</span>
              </td>
              <td>
                <a href={asset(f.l1.path)} download>
                  Parquet
                </a>
                <span class="size">{mb(f.l1.bytes)}</span>
              </td>
            </tr>
          ))
        }
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2>授權與再散布</h2>

  {/*
    Same `.layers` list, because these are the same kind of statement: a short
    term and a description that has to be readable. Reusing it also keeps the
    two halves of the chapter visually parallel — what you get, then what you
    may do with it.
  */}
  <dl class="layers">
    <dt>程式碼</dt>
    <dd>
      <a href={repoFile("LICENSE")}>MIT</a>——管線、品管規則、分析與這個網站本身。
    </dd>

    <dt>資料衍生物</dt>
    <dd>
      <a href={repoFile("LICENSE-DATA")}>CC BY 4.0</a>——上面的 L0 與 L1、
      本站所有圖表與報告。使用時請一併註明「中華民國環境部」。
    </dd>

    <dt>原始觀測</dt>
    <dd>
      權利仍屬<strong>中華民國環境部</strong>，本專案不主張任何權利。
      地圖的縣市界線來自內政部國土測繪中心，依政府資料開放授權條款第 1 版。
    </dd>
  </dl>

  <div class="note">
    <strong>L2 不發布，理由不是檔案太大。</strong>
    環境部有兩份授權敘述，對「逐時原始值的完整複本可否轉散布」互相矛盾。
    這個專案<strong>繞過這個矛盾而不是解決它</strong>：只發衍生統計產物與完整管線——
    任一種讀法都不算轉載，而管線公開就代表資料實質上仍然可得。
    查證過程與兩份敘述的原文留在 <a href={repoFile("docs/legal.md")}>docs/legal.md</a>。
  </div>

  <div class="note caveat">
    <strong>關於缺值。</strong>
    這個專案不補值。無效值標記但不刪除、超出物理範圍的值保留原數字以供檢視、
    覆蓋率不足的聚合直接<strong>不給平均值</strong>——寧可留一個洞，
    也不給一個有偏誤的數字。網站上每條線的中斷都是真的中斷。
  </div>

  <details class="publication-disagreement" data-publication-disagreement>
    <summary>萬里測站：官方停測公告與年度封存值不一致</summary>
    <div class="publication-disagreement-body" data-publication-disagreement-body>
      {wanliPm25Conflict ? (
        <>
          <p>
            <a href={wanliPm25Conflict.source_url}>環境部公告</a>記載萬里測站自
            <time datetime={wanliPm25Conflict.effective_from}>{zhDate(wanliPm25Conflict.effective_from)}</time>
            起停止更新；但同一機關發布的 2025 年度封存檔，在該時間點之後仍有
            <strong>{integer.format(wanliPm25Conflict.rows_at_or_after_event)}</strong> 筆 PM2.5 列，
            其中 <strong>{integer.format(wanliPm25Conflict.numeric_rows_at_or_after_event)}</strong> 筆有數值、
            <strong>{integer.format(wanliPm25Conflict.null_rows_at_or_after_event)}</strong> 筆保留為 null，
            最晚到 {wanliPm25Conflict.last_post_event_ts?.replace("T", " ")}。
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>這是未解的來源歧異。</strong>
            本專案按來源原樣保留並報告，沒有判定這些值有效或無效，也沒有因此改寫、刪除或補值。
          </p>
        </>
      ) : (
        <p>
          本次靜態匯出沒有可用的萬里測站公告後比對結果；這代表證據未提供，不能顯示零筆或替來源下判斷。
        </p>
      )}
    </div>
  </details>

  <div class="note">
    <strong>逐時 PM2.5 的官方但書。</strong>
    環境部 ReadMe 載明：PM2.5 自動監測（貝他射線衰減法）的小時值僅供預警參考，
    不宜直接與 24 小時空氣品質標準比較。本站的日均、年均由小時值聚合而來，
    引用時請一併理解這個限制。
  </div>
</section>

<style>
/*
 * Term beside description, hairline between rows. The term column sizes to
 * its content so the descriptions all start on one line, and they are capped
 * at the page measure like every other paragraph rather than stretching to
 * whatever the column happens to be.
 */
.layers {
  display: grid;
  gap: 0 var(--space-4);
  margin: var(--space-4) 0;
}
@media (min-width: 40rem) {
  .layers {
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, var(--measure));
  }
}
.layers dt {
  font-weight: 650;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  white-space: nowrap;
  padding: var(--space-3) 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
}
.layers dd {
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  padding: var(--space-3) 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
  text-wrap: pretty;
}
/* On one column the term and its description are one row, so only the term
   carries the rule. */
@media (max-width: 39.999rem) {
  .layers dd {
    border-top: 0;
    padding-top: 0;
  }
}

/*
 * The measurand's symbol and the file's size are both metadata about the thing
 * beside them, so both are set the way this site sets metadata everywhere else:
 * one step down, muted, and — for the sizes — in the numeric face so 5.83 and
 * 52.08 line up down the column. They sit on their own line rather than beside
 * their label, because at 390px a 「二氧化硫 SO2」 cell that wraps mid-phrase is
 * harder to scan than two short lines.
 */
.code,
.size,
.span {
  display: block;
  font-size: var(--text-sm);
  color: var(--text-muted);
  font-family: var(--font-numeric);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

/* The download links are the point of the table, so they carry the weight the
   rest of the cells give up. */
.table-wrap a[download] {
  font-weight: 650;
}

.publication-disagreement-body {
  max-width: var(--measure);
  padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4) var(--space-4);
}

.publication-disagreement-body p {
  margin: 0;
}

.publication-disagreement-body p + p {
  margin-top: var(--space-3);
}
</style>
